<title>USA: St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady.</p>
<p>Top $57.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    57.00-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows:  0.50-1.00 higher. Top 55.00</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    52.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-550 lbs    53.00</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
